<b>Thank you for your business nyo!</b>

01:07.980 --> 01:09.910
<b>No, I can't!</b>

01:10.020 --> 01:14.010
<b>I can't possibly go into
this scary store alone!</b>

01:14.650 --> 01:17.780
<b>But I heard that the ''Iron Leg Johnny''
trading card is sold here.</b>

01:17.890 --> 01:19.860
<b>Welcome to our store nyu.</b>

01:20.730 --> 01:23.750
<b>Are you looking for
anything in particular nyu?</b>

01:23.860 --> 01:27.700
<b>This little one here is a clerk too?
Is this store too scary...</b>

01:27.800 --> 01:29.960
<b>Eek!
for a normal person like me?</b>

01:30.070 --> 01:31.590
<b>Are you just looking nyu?</b>

01:31.700 --> 01:33.640
<b>Um, no. It's okay.
I've calmed down now.</b>

01:33.740 --> 01:34.760
<b>That's good nyu.</b>

01:38.080 --> 01:39.640
<b>Please help me.</b>

01:40.450 --> 01:43.440
<b>My ear's been caught between
the bookshelves since yesterday.</b>

01:43.550 --> 01:45.520
<b>Why...?
Oh, sure. Hold on.</b>

01:49.390 --> 01:50.950
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

01:51.060 --> 01:53.460
<b>I just started here
and I'm still not used to things.</b>

01:53.560 --> 01:55.250
<b>My name is Rabi-en-Rose.</b>

01:55.360 --> 01:57.760
<b>I'm a store clerk here,
although I'm only fourteen.</b>

01:57.860 --> 01:59.690
<b>Fourteen?
Hey, that's the same age as me.</b>

01:59.800 --> 02:01.600
<b>I'm Takuro Minagawa.</b>

02:01.700 --> 02:03.330
<b>Are you looking for something?</b>

02:03.440 --> 02:05.340
<b>Thank goodness, she seems normal.</b>

02:05.440 --> 02:08.630
