02:11.940 --> 02:14.040
<b>Um, yeah! I mean, yes!</b>

02:14.150 --> 02:16.580
<b>That's right, cards!
''Iron Leg Johnny'' trading cards.</b>

02:16.680 --> 02:19.850
<b>The trading card corner is over there.
If it's a popular series,</b>

02:19.950 --> 02:21.980
