02:53.250 --> 02:54.220
<b>Watch out!</b>

02:54.320 --> 02:55.980
<b>What was that? What was that?</b>

02:56.090 --> 02:57.450
<b>It's okay,
don't worry about it.</b>

02:57.560 --> 03:00.720
<b>Never mind. I'll give up
